# Origin the site is served from. Drives canonical URLs, Open Graph URLs, the
# sitemap, and whether the site is indexable at all: anything other than the
# production host makes every page noindex, so preview deploys stay out of
# search results without any extra configuration.
#
# Include the scheme. Vercel's own variables (VERCEL_URL and friends) are bare
# hostnames, so it's easy to paste one in without it — a bare host is coerced
# to https:// rather than failing the build, but set it properly.
#
# You normally don't need this at all. Unset, a Vercel deploy works it out from
# VERCEL_ENV / VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL / VERCEL_URL, and local builds fall
# back to the production domain. Set it only to override that.
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://paddlepowercebu.com
